Description: Power profile and battery manager for Lenovo LOQ
 LOQ Power Manager is a small PyQt6 application for controlling power
 profiles, battery conservation mode, and monitoring CPU/GPU temperatures
 and fan speeds on Lenovo LOQ / IdeaPad laptops.
